    Early in-person voting started 10/14 at our Municipal Office Building (100 Fairway Drive), and remains open to registered voters on regular weekday business hours (8:30 am - 4:30 pm), through 4:00 pm on Monday, November 2, 2026.In-person voting at your assigned polling location on Election Day (Tuesday, November 3, 2026) will be from 7:00 am - 8:00 pm. Polling locations are on our website and included here for your convenience.The deadline to register for a mail-in ballot has now passed. All mail ballots must be received by 8:00 p.m. on Election Day; please allow at least seven days for your ballot to arrive via mail. Mail ballots may also be received prior to the Election Day deadline via the secure Ballot Drop Box at 100 Fairway Drive.QUESTIONS? Speak with our Board of Canvassers: 401-268-1553.More information is also on our website:https://www.northkingstownri.gov/153/Board-of-Canvassers









